        "q1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "When will I notice a difference?",
            "answer": "<p>Most people feel sharper energy and focus within 2 weeks. Recovery and resilience benefits build between weeks 4–6, with compounding effects on cognition, skin and longevity from 9–12 weeks of daily use.</p>",
            "open": true
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How does the subscription work?",
            "answer": "<p>Your first order ships immediately. Subscriptions renew every 28 days (or 3 months for the prepaid plan). You can skip, pause or cancel any time from your account — no fees, no questions.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is Nicotinamide Riboside (NR)?",
            "answer": "<p>NR is a clinically studied form of vitamin B3 and a direct precursor to NAD+ — the molecule every cell needs to produce energy. NAD+ levels fall ~50% by age 40; NR helps restore them.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is NEU+ vegan and gluten-free?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. NEU+ is vegan, gluten-free, sugar-free and made in the UK. Each batch is third-party tested and Informed Sport certified for safe use by athletes.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
